          ],
          "bullets": [
            "Cloudflare announced a preview of Clairic, hosted on Workers AI as @cf/cloudflare/clairic, which it calls the first \"System One extraction model\": it reads an input in a single forward pass, returns typed values with confidence scores, and \"has no charge for output tokens\" because it generates none.",
